            <description><![CDATA[
                <p><b>PowerCue 1.0</b> — the teleprompter that follows your voice.</p>
                <ul>
                    <li>Voice following with on-device speech recognition: pause and it waits, ad-lib and it re-anchors.</li>
                    <li>Karaoke highlight, jump markers, screen directions, and a fully styled dark-mode script editor.</li>
                    <li>Detachable prompter window with full mirror flips for beam-splitter rigs.</li>
                    <li>On-screen timer, run-time pacing with per-paragraph estimates, Word import and export.</li>
                </ul>
